{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#card-zh","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recovery-resume 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的主机插件，用于在 DSH 重启后恢复被打断的任务。它监听 agent 创建和状态变化，在会话恢复为空闲后检查事件流，识别近期且尚未由用户接续的中断回合；随后发送要求先核对工作区、进程或日志真实状态再继续的消息。插件还会筛除无需重试的失败，提取未确认的工具调用和最后发言作为上下文，并以持久账本限制连续失败后的续跑频率；进行中的目标也会按状态判断是否重新授权。适合希望主机重启后自动接续 DSH 工作的人。无需额外 API key，需在 Web profile 安装。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:57","lib/index.js:83","lib/logic.js:40","lib/logic.js:109","lib/ledger.js:96"]}
{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#card-en","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-recovery-resume resumes recent, unattended turns after a DSH host restart. It checks session events when an agent becomes idle, then asks the agent to verify real world state before continuing. A persistent ledger limits repeated failures and active goals can be rearmed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:57","lib/index.js:83","lib/logic.js:40","lib/logic.js:109","lib/ledger.js:96"]}
