{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#feature-1","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recovery-resume 的功能「检测未处理的中断」：会话重新打开并进入空闲状态后，检查事件流尾部是否有近期的中断、错误或 max-tokens 回合，且之后没有用户新消息或新回合；满足条件才发起续跑。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:57","lib/logic.js:40","lib/logic.js:73"]}
{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#feature-2","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recovery-resume 的功能「恢复提示」：发现可续跑回合后，会向 agent 发送后续消息，要求先检查文件、进程或日志以确认中断步骤的真实结果，再从正确位置继续并提供可复核证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:173","lib/logic.js:109"]}
{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#feature-3","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recovery-resume 的功能「防止重复失败续跑」：插件记录会话的续跑次数和最近时间；连续失败达到上限时暂停自动续跑，并在重试间隔内冷却。检测到任务已有进展后会重置失败计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/ledger.js:96","lib/ledger.js:150"]}
{"unit_id":"flandre2233__dsh-recovery-resume#feature-4","repo":"flandre2233/dsh-recovery-resume","commit":"c8e0f0aa88042d4f98e027875eb61b83d042eb27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recovery-resume 的功能「继续活动目标」：发送续跑消息后，插件会读取 agent 的 goal，只在目标仍为 active 且中断原因符合条件时调用 resume；遇到 revision 变化会重新读取并最多重试一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:207","lib/index.js:223","lib/logic.js:167"]}
